    "File Island's original code is proprietary and source-available. File Island includes FFmpeg 8.1.2 under the GNU LGPL v2.1 or later. The corresponding source archive, verified release signature, build recipe, license, and notices are included with the project and every binary Release. No GPL or nonfree components are enabled." : {
